# scenario: funded
# size: 360x640
# Settings > Recovery words: the warning, the words, and Copy, whose words leave
# the clipboard after 60 s.
action app.settings
click Recovery words
expect Write these words down
expect keep your invite codes too
expect-numbered 12
shot words
click Copy
expect Copied. Clear your clipboard when done.
shot copied
expect-clipboard demo
click Back
expect Backup
# The page goes when its transition ends.
wait 1000
expect-absent 12. demo
wait 57000
expect-clipboard demo
wait 3000
expect-clipboard-empty
